  "question": {
    "text": "An isosceles triangle made of wood of base <math><mn>10</mn></math> feet and height <math><mn>8</mn></math> feet is placed vertically with its base on the ground and vertex directly above it. If the triangle faces the sun whose altitude is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math>,&nbsp;then the tangent of the angle at the apex of the shadow is"
  },
