  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is the triangle and <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></math> is its shadow on the ground<br />Height of the triangular shadow <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0034_7f99254b04de.png\" style=\"width:1.38681in;height:1.77361in\" /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>192</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>192</mn><